        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    qualified_expenses = 8500.0\n    magi = 85000.0\n    phase_out_start = 80000.0\n    phase_out_end = 90000.0\n    credit_rate = 0.20\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    potential_credit = min(qualified_expenses, 10000.0) * credit_rate\n    phase_out_percentage = (phase_out_end - magi) / (\n        phase_out_end - phase_out_start\n    )\n    answer = potential_credit * phase_out_percentage\n\n    # return answer\n    return round(answer, 2)\n```",
